ng at each other. 19) The shepherds hurrying down the hillside toward Bethlehem, staffs in hand, happy and excited, lantern light ahead. 20) The shepherds arriving at the stable doorway, peeking in quietly with amazed smiles, soft lantern light. 21) The shepherds kneeling quietly beside the manger looking at baby Jesus, Mary and Joseph smiling warmly, the animals nearby. 22) The shepherds leaving the stable, smiling and joyful, telling people on the road about what they saw, a bright star shining overhead. 23) Mary sitting beside the manger with baby Jesus, quietly smiling, thinking in her heart, a bright star shining above the stable. 24) Grandpa Sol's porch at golden hour with twinkle lights, Zara, Eli and Pip hugging Grandpa Sol, a small wrapped present and a paper star nearby, everyone smiling. Create all 12 as separate cartoon images in the same soft 3D style (not realistic)."